{
  "slug": "health-framework",
  "name": "Health Framework",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Health & training meta-router — 12 evidence-based frameworks (Mediterranean Diet/PREDIMED, Low-Carb/Keto, Intermittent Fasting, Macro Tracking, Progressive Overload, Strength Basics, Hypertrophy Volume/RP, Polarized Endurance/Seiler, Sleep Foundations, Recovery & Periodization with overtraining-vs-burnout flowchart, Blood Biomarkers, Body Composition). Educational use only — NOT medical advice, NOT a training prescription. Invoke /health.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `fit` (Health & training meta-router — auto-selects from 13 evidence-based frameworks (nutrition, training, sleep, measurement, occupational health) based on…), `blood-biomarkers` (Blood biomarker interpretation — lipids (ApoB, LDL, HDL, TG), fasting glucose & HbA1c, hs-CRP, thyroid (TSH, FT4), vitamin…), `body-composition` (Body composition measurement — DEXA (reference) vs BIA (InBody) vs skinfold vs photos·mirror), `hypertrophy-volume` (Hypertrophy volume management — quantify stimulus via weekly sets per muscle group (MV/MEV/MAV/MRV)), `intermittent-fasting` (Intermittent Fasting (IF) — 16:8 TRE, 5:2, ADF), `low-carb-keto` (Low-carb / ketogenic diet — severely restrict carbohydrates (<50g/day) to induce ketosis), `macro-tracking` (Macro tracking — prioritize total calories (energy balance) + protein (1.6–2.2 g/kg), with carbs and fats allocated by…), `mediterranean-diet` (Mediterranean Diet — among dietary interventions, the strongest RCT evidence for cardiovascular events, mortality, diabetes, and cognitive decline…), and 5 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install health-framework@claude-community` from `ironyjk/health-framework`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
